  "releaseNotes": "-\n            1.0.0: Initial.\n            1.1.0: Get with predicate and factory.\n            1.2.0: Generate IComparable\n            1.3.0: Using scope. Generate IFormattable. Generate IEnumerable.\n            1.3.1: Thread safe scope. Optimizations.\n            1.3.2: Nullability annotations\n            2.0.0: The Flyweight and GenerateFlyweightClass attributes moved to the Skaar.Flyweight library instead of being generated into each assembly (fixes CS0436). Skaar.Flyweight.CodeGeneration 2.x requires Skaar.Flyweight 2.x. Generated code no longer requires implicit usings.",
